# Duplicate login: while this client sits on the select screen, the runner logs the same account in
# with botclient (HOOK kick) -> back to the login screen with an explanation.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m4_kick
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.back
waitfor charselect+idle+chars0 900
screenshot 01_before_kick.png
log HOOK kick
waitfor login+modal 1800
expecttext messagebox.text başka bir yerden
screenshot 02_kicked.png
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor login+idle 60
quit